    "summary": "Canada is a vast North American country known for its diverse landscapes, including forests, lakes, mountain ranges, and Arctic regions. Stretching from the Atlantic to the Pacific and northward into the Arctic Ocean, it is the world's second-largest country by total area. Its capital is Ottawa, and its three largest metropolitan areas are Toronto, Montreal, and Vancouver. Canada is a parliamentary democracy and a constitutional monarchy, with King Charles III as the ceremonial head of state and Prime Minister Mark Carney as the head of government. The country is officially bilingual, with English and French as its federal languages. Canada's economy is advanced and diversified, relying on abundant natural resources and well-developed international trade networks. It is recognized for its high quality of life, economic competitiveness, and commitment to multiculturalism. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada?utm_source=openai))",
